  A translation of HOL Light's `Multivariate/topology.ml`, in the style of
  HolMultiLib/Metric.lean: pure, the proofs translated by hand, one `let` per
  OCaml `let`, in file order.  What topology.ml uses from the core library,
  from Library/card.ml and iter.ml (and wo.ml, floor.ml, products.ml and
  permutations.ml, which they load), and from Multivariate/misc.ml,
  vectors.ml, determinants.ml and metric.ml is passed in `TopologyDeps`;
  SessionMultiLib/Topology.lean supplies it.
-/

